<section xmlns="http://xml.house.gov/schemas/uslm/1.0" style="-uslm-lc:I80" id="id0d659e75-810c-11f1-b7ce-bdea3d14cbdd" identifier="/us/usc/t16/s1685"><num value="1685">§ 1685.</num><heading> Regulations</heading><content>
<p style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0">The Secretary shall issue such regulations as the Secretary deems necessary to implement the provisions of this subchapter.</p>
</content><sourceCredit id="id0d659e76-810c-11f1-b7ce-bdea3d14cbdd">(<ref href="/us/pl/96/554/s6">Pub. L. 96–554, § 6</ref>, <date date="1980-12-19">Dec. 19, 1980</date>, <ref href="/us/stat/94/3258">94 Stat. 3258</ref>.)</sourceCredit>
